Several iPhone apps now put a breath or a delay in front of Instagram. We compared one sec, ScreenZen, Clearspace, Opal and Apple's free Screen Time and Shortcuts tools, using only their own App Store listings, checked November 2026.

The research is encouraging but narrow. In a 2023 PNAS field study of one sec, actual app openings fell 57% over six weeks. The study measured opens and satisfaction, not how people felt during or after a session. Friction at the open works on the reflex tap. It doesn't reach the wired feeling 20 minutes in.

The article includes a 30-second Calm 4-6 breath you can use at the open or mid-scroll. DeRot is building an app for that mid-scroll moment; we disclose that up front and don't rank ourselves. {url}
